// Stormglass Commons bounded cinematic observer sequence.
//
// This source owns two exact presentation beats over the admitted MV-V7
// observer tableau. Camera framing, captions, and optional local audio are
// read-only exhibit surfaces. They cannot affect the village, residents,
// research identities, schedules, observations, actions, or receipts.

composition "Stormglass Observer Cinematic Sequence" {
  metadata {
    schema: "hololand.model-village.observer-cinematic-sequence.v1"
    assetId: "mv-stormglass-observer-cinematic-sequence-v1"
    title: "Stormglass Commons: Proof in the Light"
